The datasets used in this project is the [140K Real and Fake Faces](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/xhlulu/140k-real-and-fake-faces) dataset available on Kaggle.

It contains:
1. Training set
2. Validation set
3. Test set

To use it:
1. Download the dataset from Kaggle.
2. Unzip it locally.
3. Update the `main_path` in the code to point to your local path, for example:
   ```python
   main_path = '/Users/<yourname>/Downloads/real_vs_fake/real-vs-fake'
